WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,970 --> 00:00:06,970
Leader Bai

2
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:09,520
Here we go

3
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:16,010
I haven’t drunk the tea yet, so I don’t want the drawings either. Li Changsheng

4
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:17,810
You dare to kill my people

5
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:19,810
I will let your wife and children be buried with her.

6
00:00:20,210 --> 00:00:22,460
You talk about my wife again

7
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:27,230
Tonight I will cut out your tongue first Li Changsheng

8
00:00:27,430 --> 00:00:28,630
You'd better think clearly

9
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:30,230
I got the documents from the province

10
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:32,430
If something happens to me on the backer tonight

11
00:00:32,830 --> 00:00:35,030
Do you think that interconnection agreement can protect you?

12
00:00:35,430 --> 00:00:37,960
Provincial documents, right?

13
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:39,360
Now I know I'm afraid
